Patch for ark (https://github.com/posit-dev/ark, MIT License) at commit
5564f488e539cfdd344f583a7aeb40250f7d20d3 (Ark 0.1.252+266).

Makes ark's DAP server, LSP server and help proxy reject TCP connections from
processes that are not owned by the same user as ark. See README.md
("Modifications") and SECURITY-NOTE.md in the positron-macos-server
repository.

Apply in the ark checkout with: git apply ark-peer-check.patch

